OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787681944
OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,FAhead of the Premier League's opening
OL,7,Fseason, its CEO Richard Masters tells
OL,8,FITV News that he supports Uefa's
OL,9,Fdecision to boycott the World Cup over
OL,10,FGianni Infantino's failed private
OL,11,Finvestment plan
OL,13,FThe head of the English Premier League
OL,14,Fhas told ITV News that he is
OL,15,F"supportive" of Uefa's move to boycott
OL,16,Fthe World Cup and other Fifa
OL,17,Ftournaments over Gianni Infantino's
OL,18,Ffailed private investment plan.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
