OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787681944
OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,FIn an interview with Sports Editor
OL,7,FSteve Scott, Richard Masters also said
OL,8,Fhe does not think Infantino's
OL,9,Fpresidency of Fifa is tenable and
OL,10,Fcalled for a "unity candidate" to
OL,11,Freplace him.
OL,13,FInfantino faced immense criticism over
OL,14,Fhis plan to sell stakes in a World Cup
OL,15,Fcompany, named Fifa Forward Enterprise
OL,16,F(FFE), to private investors.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
