OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787681944
OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,FThe plan raised fears over excessive
OL,7,Fcommercialisation changing the game
OL,8,Fforever, and was rejected by three
OL,9,Fcontinental confederations before it
OL,10,Fwas withdrawn.
OL,12,FDespite Infantino saying the FFE
OL,13,Fproposal was "off the table" following
OL,14,Fa crisis meeting in Morocco, Uefa said
OL,15,Fits boycott threat ` backed by the
OL,16,FEnglish FA ` still stands.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
