PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787681944
OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,FUefa demanded assurances that "such
OL,7,Fattempts to disfigure the game in this
OL,8,Fway will never be made again", and
OL,9,Fsaid that this condition still has not
OL,10,Fbeen met.
OL,12,FAsked if he backed the ongoing
OL,13,FEuropean resistance, Masters told ITV
OL,14,FNews: "Yeah, I'm supportive of the
OL,15,FFA's position on these things.
OL,17,F"These are really difficult things, to
OL,18,Fboycott and to withdraw your teams.
OL,19,FBut I think they're issues of Fifa's
OL,20,Fmaking, not of Uefa's and the national
OL,21,Fassociations."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
