OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,FInternational football has remained in
OL,7,Fturmoil following Infantino's
OL,8,Fannouncement shortly after the 2026
OL,9,FWorld Cup, with many national football
OL,10,Fassociations accusing him of a lack of
OL,11,Ftransparency over the plans.
OL,13,FInfantino has said he intends to stand
OL,14,Ffor re-election at the 77th FIFA
OL,15,FCongress in Rabat, Morocco on March
OL,16,F18, next year ` which Masters suggests
OL,17,Fwould be the end of the line for the
OL,18,FSwiss president.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,320,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787681944
OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,F"They're not going to support him in
OL,7,Fan election if it gets to that," he
OL,8,Fsaid. "And obviously that means there
OL,9,Fneeds to be another candidate, a unity
OL,10,Fcandidate.
OL,12,F"We've got a situation at the moment
OL,13,Fwhere three of the confederations are
OL,14,Fseemingly not supporting Gianni going
OL,15,Fforward into those elections, whilst
OL,16,Fthe other three are supporting or
OL,17,Fundeclared.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,320,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787681944
OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,F"That's a recipe for division and
OL,7,Fstasis. And that's not what the of the
OL,8,Fgame needs. It needs someone else. I
OL,9,Fthink that can. That can drive the
OL,10,Fgame forward."
OL,12,FThis is the strongest condemnation yet
OL,13,Fby Masters, who as well as serving as
OL,14,Fthe Premier League's CEO, also chairs
OL,15,Fthe World Leagues Association, which
OL,16,Frepresents 50 club leagues from across
OL,17,Fthe world.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
