OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787681944
OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,FIn July the association made a
OL,7,Fstatement opposing Fifa's investment
OL,8,Fproposals, saying that as the global
OL,9,Fgoverning body of football, its
OL,10,Fresponsibility extends far beyond its
OL,11,Fown tournaments.
OL,13,F"The FIFA World Cup value, and more
OL,14,Fgenerally of national team football,
OL,15,Fis the result of a collective effort
OL,16,Facross the entire football pyramid.
OL,17,FNational team football is built upon
OL,18,Fthe release of players by their
OL,19,Fclubs," it said.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
