OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787681944
OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,FInfantino appears to have faced
OL,7,Fopposition even within Fifa's inner
OL,8,Fcircle, with the news breaking on
OL,9,FMonday that the association's chief
OL,10,Foperating officer Kevin Lamour had
OL,11,Fbeen sacked following criticism of the
OL,12,Fpresident.
OL,14,FAround the start of the crisis, Kevin
OL,15,FLamour told the Associated Press that
OL,16,FFifa's administration had been
OL,17,F"deceived" by Infantino's lack of
OL,18,Fopenness and "deserve better than
OL,19,Fcontempt and intimidation".
OL,26,@yD@AOUyD@JO]zD@NOU{D@ZO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
