CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787681944
OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,FAs far as Masters is concerned, this
OL,7,Fis a "massive own goal" for Fifa,
OL,8,Fsuggesting it serves as a distraction
OL,9,Fthat prolongs the crisis currently
OL,10,Ffacing the sport.
OL,12,F"We should be sitting here talking and
OL,13,Freflecting about the World cup and
OL,14,Fwhat it means for football moving
OL,15,Fforward, talking about Spain's win,
OL,16,Fbut we're not. We're talking about
OL,17,Fgovernance and we're talking about FEE.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,320,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787681944
OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,F"I knew Kevin in my role as chair of
OL,7,Fthe World Leagues Association. He was
OL,8,Freally brought in to bring about
OL,9,Fbetter relations with other
OL,10,Fstakeholders.
OL,12,F"He's a good guy and one of the few
OL,13,Fpeople who can really have an open
OL,14,Fconversation with at Fifa".
OL,16,FMoving to domestic football ahead of
OL,17,Fthe opening weekend of the 2026/27
OL,18,Fseason, Masters said he understood the
OL,19,Ffrustration felt over the delayed
OL,20,Fverdict on alleged breaches of
OL,21,Ffinancial rules by Manchester City.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G11/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
