OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787681944
OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,FMasters accepted that it has taken
OL,7,F'longer than expected' to reach a
OL,8,Fverdict on Manchester City's charges
OL,9,Fbut said the process must be allowed
OL,10,Fto take its course
OL,12,FThe club was charged with more than
OL,13,F100 breaches in February 2023
OL,14,Ffollowing a four-year investigation,
OL,15,Fwith a 12-week hearing led by an
OL,16,Findependent commission ending in
OL,17,FDecember 2024.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G12/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,320,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31913
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787681944
OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,FManchester City has denied all
OL,7,Fcharges, and a verdict is yet to be
OL,8,Fdelivered nearly two years after the
OL,9,Fhearing.
OL,11,FMasters accepted that the process has
OL,12,Ftaken "longer than expected" but that
OL,13,Fhe hopes it isn't "damaging
OL,14,Freputation" of the Premier League.
OL,16,F"I can't speak about it, our rules are
OL,17,Fvery clear," Masters said, adding: "I
OL,18,Funderstand that people are frustrated.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G13/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,320,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31914
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787681944
OL,3,CPremier League CEO tells ITV News he
OL,4,Csupports Uefa's boycott of Fifa
OL,6,F"It has taken longer than anyone
OL,7,Fexpected. But as I said, you know, we
OL,8,Fhave to allow the process to take its
OL,9,Fcourse.
OL,11,F"Ultimately, the Premier League's job
OL,12,Fis to, if there's evidence strong
OL,13,Fenough, to put allegations before an
OL,14,Findependent commission and allow that
OL,15,Findependent commission to establish
OL,16,Fthe truth.
OL,18,F"That process should not be qualified
OL,19,Fby the length of time that it takes to
OL,20,Freach a verdict."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G14/14
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
